{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now let me break this down into phases with detailed subtasks for your team.

"},{"type":"tool-call","toolCallId":"em2DarJ5OyaQVLLScsPF2v6fRn9IOThT","toolName":"createSubtask","input":{"title":"Site Assessment & Measurements","description":"Inspect the chosen tree. Measure trunk diameter, branch spread, height above ground, and soil/root conditions. Verify the tree is structurally sound and can support the planned load. Check for power lines, obstacles, and access routes. Confirm tree species is safe for building.","taskId":"01a0f19f-3a5f-7000-bf66-401e93144ca0"}},{"type":"tool-call","toolCallId":"WABUHOxOChWDojZUdnjByS7U2pHwU38P","toolName":"createSubtask","input":{"title":"Design & Blueprint Creation","description":"Draw scaled plans including floor plan, elevation, and load-bearing calculations. Decide on size, layout, number of decks, loft bed, stairs/ladder, and features (window, door, roof overhang). Specify materials: lumber type, fasteners, rope, hardware. Include a budget estimate.","taskId":"01a0f19f-3a5f-7000-bf66-401e93144ca0"}},{"type":"tool-call","toolCallId":"gXE9lRKvnc1VmnTOrTVudmgB6AUN1EGH","toolName":"createSubtask","input":{"title":"Material Procurement & Preparation","description":"Purchase all materials per the blueprint: lumber, plywood, fasteners, rope/cable, hinges, hinges, hardware, finish paint/stain, and tools. Pre-cut and pre-assemble components off-site where possible. Organize materials by build sequence.","taskId":"01a0f19f-3a5f-7000-bf66-401e93144ca0"}},{"type":"tool-call","toolCallId":"3SZHYOFL4gp6oHs3rGJ84ew5of78FbTC","toolName":"createSubtask","input":{"title":"Foundation & Anchoring Installation","description":"Install the structural anchoring system. Attach spreader bars and lag bolts/through-bolts to distribute weight across the trunk without damaging it. Build and secure any ground-level base, platform, or brackets. Ensure the anchor point is load-tested and level.","taskId":"01a0f19f-3a5f-7000-bf66-401e93144ca0"}},{"type":"tool-call","toolCallId":"r6k5Aayff38Kil3qljnBZkxasCeBWW77","toolName":"createSubtask","input":{"title":"Platform & Deck Construction","description":"Build the main floor platform and any additional decks or wraparound decks. Secure joists and decking to the anchoring system. Ensure the floor is flat, even, and safely attached. Install any under-deck storage or seating.","taskId":"01a0f19f-3a5f-7000-bf66-401e93144ca0"}},{"type":"tool-call","toolCallId":"esAC3E1DhDTSAvwf46CvD9TezRISUKL5","toolName":"createSubtask","input":{"title":"Stairs, Ladder, & Access","description":"Construct and install the access system — stairs, ladder, rope ladder, or swing stairs. Ensure proper rise/run, handrails where required, and secure attachment to both the platform and the tree. Make access safe and stable.","taskId":"01a0f19f-3a5f-7000-bf66-401e93144ca0"}},{"type":"tool-call","toolCallId":"yyDioRgwZ8BZWv5c04BeXjzlIpZ5Xd6T","toolName":"createSubtask","input":{"title":"Enclosure & Walls","description":"Build the walls, roof, and enclosure. Frame and install siding, roofing (shingles, tarpaper, or corrugated), and any enclosed loft or room. Ensure weatherproofing and proper overhangs for drainage.","taskId":"01a0f19f-3a5f-7000-bf66-401e93144ca0"}},{"type":"tool-call","toolCallId":"giS2rXPulRDv7oZ5Pf0lw6jpSObvQi0W","toolName":"createSubtask","input":{"title":"Door, Window, & Interior Features","description":"Install the door, window(s), and interior elements such as a loft bed, desk, shelving, rope bridge, or play features. Hang hardware and ensure everything is functional and secure.","taskId":"01a0f19f-3a5f-7000-bf66-401e93144ca0"}},{"type":"tool-call","toolCallId":"yYfJXibC9NxTZkUgvkwkSTdMsNzlJKOb","toolName":"createSubtask","input":{"title":"Finishing & Weatherproofing","description":"Apply exterior stain or paint and sealants to protect against weather. Caulk seams, check roof integrity, and finish all exposed wood. Ensure a durable, weather-resistant exterior.","taskId":"01a0f19f-3a5f-7000-bf66-401e93144ca0"}},{"type":"tool-call","toolCallId":"5jeHSAWzmuP8ooJk