ask","input":{"title":"Platform & Deck Construction","description":"Build the main floor platform and any additional decks or wraparound decks. Secure joists and decking to the anchoring system. Ensure the floor is flat, even, and safely attached. Install any under-deck storage or seating.","taskId":"01a0f19f-3a5f-7000-bf66-401e93144ca0"}},{"type":"tool-call","toolCallId":"esAC3E1DhDTSAvwf46CvD9TezRISUKL5","toolName":"createSubtask","input":{"title":"Stairs, Ladder, & Access","description":"Construct and install the access system — stairs, ladder, rope ladder, or swing stairs. Ensure proper rise/run, handrails where required, and secure attachment to both the platform and the tree. Make access safe and stable.","taskId":"01a0f19f-3a5f-7000-bf66-401e93144ca0"}},{"type":"tool-call","toolCallId":"yyDioRgwZ8BZWv5c04BeXjzlIpZ5Xd6T","toolName":"createSubtask","input":{"title":"Enclosure & Walls","description":"Build the walls, roof, and enclosure. Frame and install siding, roofing (shingles, tarpaper, or corrugated), and any enclosed loft or room. Ensure weatherproofing and proper overhangs for drainage.","taskId":"01a0f19f-3a5f-7000-bf66-401e93144ca0"}},{"type":"tool-call","toolCallId":"giS2rXPulRDv7oZ5Pf0lw6jpSObvQi0W","toolName":"createSubtask","input":{"title":"Door, Window, & Interior Features","description":"Install the door, window(s), and interior elements such as a loft bed, desk, shelving, rope bridge, or play features. Hang hardware and ensure everything is functional and secure.","taskId":"01a0f19f-3a5f-7000-bf66-401e93144ca0"}},{"type":"tool-call","toolCallId":"yYfJXibC9NxTZkUgvkwkSTdMsNzlJKOb","toolName":"createSubtask","input":{"title":"Finishing & Weatherproofing","description":"Apply exterior stain or paint and sealants to protect against weather. Caulk seams, check roof integrity, and finish all exposed wood. Ensure a durable, weather-resistant exterior.","taskId":"01a0f19f-3a5f-7000-bf66-401e93144ca0"}},{"type":"tool-call","toolCallId":"5jeHSAWzmuP8ooJk